h Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "At the Art Gallery", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking for Clarification and Emphasizing a Point", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details on what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use a question at the beginning of a statement or question to ask for clarification like: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Don't you think</span> ... ?</span><br/>Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: </span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Simple question:</span> What are you going to do after dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Direct Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you remember ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Can you remind me who the artist you wanted to see is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you remember where he's from?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Could you tell me again who that is?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Showing You Understand Someone's Feelings or Emotions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In conversation, it is natural to show that you understand someone's feelings and emotions. It helps to use different kinds of structures and expressions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structures:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You <span class=\"strong\">ought to be/must be</span> + adjective<br/>It <span class=\"strong\">ought to be</span>/must be + adjective<br/>You've/It's <span class=\"strong\">got to be</span> + adjective<br/>I'm sure that's/you're + adjective<br/>Aren't you + adjective?<br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use these expressions:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I get it.<br/>I know what you mean.<br/>I hear you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You must feel really silly right now ...", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I know what you mean.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must be desperate for a social life. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pop in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go into a place (a building)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's pop in at the art gallery.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about art.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to read up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to read about someone or something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll read up online about him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to quiz", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to test someone about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When we get there, I'll quiz you. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "art installation", "type": "name"}, {"content": " an artistic exhibit that transforms a space", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love seeing art installations. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "imaginative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing creativity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Wow, this is really imaginative stuff! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "connoisseur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an expert judge of a particular topic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must be an art connoisseur by now!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enlightening", "type": "name"}, {"content": "giving someone knowledge", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Workshops are really enlightening. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "workshop", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a meeting where people talk and learn about a certain subject", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should come to an art workshop with me sometime. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Do research on the Internet about an artist of your choice and make notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down six interesting facts about the artist.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Get information about your partner's artist by asking questions for clarification.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your research with your partner by answering their questions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find information on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions for clarification.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give information about an artist.", "type": "text"}]}]}